Akampana drives chariot at monkey chiefs and routs them with arrows --- Hanumān rallies chiefs and charges shaking earth --- Akampana showers Hanumān who ignores shafts and hurls mountain peak --- Akampana shatters peak with crescent arrows --- Hanumān uproots aśvakarṇa tree and crushes elephants chariots and footmen --- Akampana pierces Hanumān with fourteen arrows --- Hanumān smashes Akampana head and demons flee to Laṅkā --- Monkeys honor Hanumān whom Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sugrīva and Vibhīṣaṇa praise